// THE MODULE'S OWN ROSTER OF CATALOG ROWS. It lives here rather than in a witness so that a
// consumer asking "every AMD processor this repository models" reads one authority, and so that
// an author adding a row is editing the roster in the same file rather than remembering a test
// elsewhere. The roster is still hand-authored -- a genuinely closed denominator would have to be
// discovered from the module tree, which is lens work -- so this narrows the gap rather than
// closing it, and says so.
data amd_cpu_catalog_rows: List<extdeps.cpu.types.CpuModelCatalogRow> = [
  ryzen_5_3600_catalog,
  ryzen_7_pro_8700ge_catalog,
  ryzen_9_7950x3d_catalog,
]
